## 5.19. Schur-Weyl duality for $`GL(V)`
%%%
tag := "Chapter5/Introduction_5.19/heading-1"
%%%

The Schur-Weyl duality for the Lie algebra $`\mathfrak{gl}(V)` implies a similar statement for the group $`GL(V)`.
